  m_text: '<b>SWITCHEROO RULES</b>


    <b>Your colour</b>    2 s turbo + 1 charge

    <b>Rival''s
    colour</b>    Swap into their car

    <b>3 charges</b>    Auto shield: no swaps
    for 8 s

    <b>Shield activates</b>    Charges reset


    <size=24>After
    a swap, nobody can swap again for 4 s.

    Charges stay with the car, so a swap
    steals

    their stash. Behind? Hunt rival colours.

    Ahead? Dodge them.</size>'
